  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 3140 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["E6", "D3"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "The pegfilgrastim product on our label is manufactured by Kashiv BioSciences, LLC (FEI 3011289655).",
      "cites": ["E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1038740 of that plant ended on 2018-01-26 and was classified Official Action Indicated (OAI).",
      "cites": ["E6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "That OAI classification became known to FDA on 2018-02-16 per an FMD-145 letter.",
      "cites": ["E6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The most recent inspection (1241763) ended on 2024-06-14 and was classified Voluntary Action Indicated (VAI).",
      "cites": ["E7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 15 days of supply on hand at current use, and Corvale General has 24 days.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-selected alternative is Accord BioPharma, Inc., which is not on FDA's shortage list today and its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["E9"]
    }
  ]
}
